  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1 — Completed undo/redo unification (issue #107): HexEditor ↔ CodeEditor now share a single UndoEngine via the IUndoAwareEditor contract. Bundled with the NuGet wave v0.6.5.15. No public API changes. 1.1.0 — IUndoAwareEditor contract + HexByteUndoEntry for shared undo engine; DocumentBuffer undo wiring; regression test suite added (ByteProvider, UndoRedo, Search, Edits, Changeset).",
